1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:08,760
Sometimes when we work in it, we have to bring some bad news or we have to tell that we don't like

2
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:09,390
something.

3
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:18,390
Let's have a look at examples on how to make that in a professional and nice way to say that you don't

4
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:19,640
like something.

5
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:23,340
You can use phrases like, I am not into it.

6
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:29,400
You can say, I'm not into this design, I'm not into this technology.

7
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,920
I am not into this approach.

8
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:40,350
Also, you can say I prefer, yeah, this is nice, but I prefer this technology.

9
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:42,840
I prefer this approach.

10
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:45,030
I prefer this project.

11
00:00:45,750 --> 00:00:46,500
Next.

12
00:00:46,890 --> 00:00:49,020
I'm not crazy about it.

13
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:54,800
To say that you don't like something you can say, I am not crazy about this idea.

14
00:00:54,830 --> 00:00:59,000
This technology, this project or this team, mate.

15
00:00:59,930 --> 00:01:00,620
Good.

16
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:05,150
Also, you can say I am not a big fan of something.

17
00:01:05,750 --> 00:01:08,810
I am not a big fan of BHP, to be honest.

18
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:12,980
I am not a big fan of WordPress.

19
00:01:13,250 --> 00:01:17,000
I am not a big fan of Kanban approach.

20
00:01:17,330 --> 00:01:18,080
Good.

21
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:22,880
Now let's have a look on how to bring bad news in English.

22
00:01:23,270 --> 00:01:25,700
You can start with I am afraid.

23
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:30,020
I am afraid we won't be able to meet the deadline.

24
00:01:30,170 --> 00:01:35,330
I am afraid we have to increase the budget for this project.

25
00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:43,100
Or you can say I'm sorry to have to tell you that I am sorry to have to tell you that we decided to

26
00:01:43,100 --> 00:01:45,290
move on with other candidates.

27
00:01:45,290 --> 00:01:52,550
Or I am sorry to have to tell you that you are not the best fit for this project.

28
00:01:52,730 --> 00:01:56,270
Also, you can say I regret.

29
00:01:56,480 --> 00:02:04,740
I regret to inform you that we have decided to go on with this company.

30
00:02:04,740 --> 00:02:11,160
Or I regret to inform you that I have decided to leave this project.

31
00:02:11,610 --> 00:02:12,390
Good.

32
00:02:12,420 --> 00:02:18,420
Now you can use these phrases to talk about some bad news at work.

33
00:02:18,450 --> 00:02:19,320
Thank you.
